// CotSC localization Batch 23: QCHDARK
@1 = ~Hey! It's me, Imoen! Do you recognise me?~
@2 = ~Im... Imoen?~
@3 = ~You're an illusion.~
@4 = ~I was so lonely here. We should hang out, just like during our childhood, remember?~
@5 = ~Let's play hide and seek. You hide... I seek.~
@6 = ~You're an illusion using my friend to get to me. That won't work.~
@7 = ~If you don't want to play with me, I'll play with you.~
@8 = ~Hey! It's me, Imoen! Do you recognise me?~
@9 = ~Who... who are you?!~
@10 = ~I am you, silly. Reflection of your soul from its darkest depths. The parts you are too afraid to look into.~
@11 = ~You are not me! Only one of us can exist! This is nothing but a mere illusion.~
@12 = ~Illusion. Call it whatever you want. You cannot deny the truth. I am your better. If you embrace me, together we can achieve greatness. All you have to do is... accept me into your already wicked heart.~
@13 = ~Never! I will sooner die than accept evil into my heart. Bhaal and I share blood, and only that!~
@14 = ~As you wish, sister. If you shan't embrace me, I will do so for you.~
@15 = ~Hey! It's me, Imoen! Do you recognise me?~
